gs back so many memories! Oh my old stuffed animals. I still love them.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: There are at least five more in the closet.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Pugsly, my stuffed dog. He's so cute.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Yes, I kept your toys and posters.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob04re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh Mom, that's sweet. You even kept my old unicorn comforter with the rainbows!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Honey, I'll never throw anything of yours out.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Nothing?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Well, there were some old clothes from your teenage years.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh my goth phase ... the black clothes and lipstick.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Don't you love all the old photographs of your friends too?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, and look at this note I wrote to my penpal in South Africa.", "time": "21500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob04re2img08.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: What was her name again?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Rita de Boer.  She used to send me little presents too!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: What are you doing?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Could I take Pugsly back with me to my apartment as a little memento?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Sure. I hope that cat of yours, Meenee, doesn't get too upset.", "time": "48300", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}